[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989141380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989141380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989141380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yKq2E","user":{"login":"HungryProton","id":52043844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQzODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52043844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton","html_url":"https://github.com/HungryProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:02:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:02:07Z","body":"I can confirm, even on a small project, this popup reappears at each launch and it takes a while.\nWould be nice to have either an editor setting to turn it off, or a button to cancel that process (or maybe move it in the background, does this really needs to block all user inputs?) ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989141380/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989166087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989166087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989166087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yKw4H","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:22:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:22:36Z","body":"It's a bug, not something that should be made configurable. It's obviously not expected that it would:\n1. Take so long in the first place\n2. Run every time\n\nSee the discussion in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313#issuecomment-2985202511.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989166087/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989176153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989176153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989176153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yKzVZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:29:33Z","body":"Thumbnail generation can run in background, but it's not supported on Compatibility renderer I think, so it's blocking.\nThe new previews invalidated all old thumbnails, so they are regenerated for the whole project once you open it for the first time in the new version. But it should happen only once, the previews normally refresh when their scene was modified.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989176153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989181635","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989181635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989181635,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yK0rD","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:34:02Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:34:02Z","body":"Here's a small MRP - really just a fresh Godot project with [Kenney's Input Prompts pack](https://kenney.nl/assets/input-prompts):\n\n[test-generating-thumbnails_2025-06-19_14-28-41.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20825832/test-generating-thumbnails_2025-06-19_14-28-41.zip)\n\nRunning on macOS Sequoia, every time I open this project, the \"Generate Thumbnails\" progress bar appears and I have to wait for it to finish. (This is also with the Compatibility renderer.)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9275a793-adbd-4a5c-9fec-70b2d1bf72b1","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989181635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989201066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989201066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989201066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yK5aq","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:48:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T21:48:50Z","body":"Yeah when you switch renderer (tested with Forward+), the issue is gone.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989201066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989232505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989232505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989232505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yLBF5","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T22:05:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T23:09:43Z","body":">or maybe move it in the background, does this really needs to block all user inputs?\n\nWhen creating thumbnails, we respect ```RenderingServerGlobals::rasterizer->can_create_resources_async()```, it returns false when using Compatibility renderer, so creating thumbnail stays on main thread and being blocking. But honestly I have no idea why we can't create textures on a thread when using GLES3, when I start developing this feature, there was an ancient comment someone left there and tell us not to do it on thread with GLES3, with no clear explaination. So I followed it.\n\nEDIT:\nThe declaration is at **drivers/gles3/rasterizer_gles3.h:137**\n```c++\n_ALWAYS_INLINE_ bool can_create_resources_async() const { return false; }\n```\n\n\nIf someone have any clue of this restriction of Compatibility renderer, please provide us details.\n\n>Running on macOS Sequoia, every time I open this project, the \"Generate Thumbnails\" progress bar appears and I have to wait for it to finish. (This is also with the Compatibility renderer.)\n\nBehavior in the video is expected, let me point out what's actually happening: In **Compatibility renderer**, If your project has opened up for the first time and finished generating all thumbnails, they are cached for sure, and this process might take long depend on project size. \n\nAfter you open the project for the second time, it **scans and reads through all file to detect md5 checksum diffs**, also assigns cached thumbnails to scene files if did not change. That's what it's actually doing, it's just the progress bar still shows \"Generate thumbnails\". But the process should be significantly faster compare to the first run, since it's just comparing md5 checksums.\n\nThough, the process of scanning file md5 checksums should be safe to move to background. I will investigate a solution for this first.\n\nNote: For anyone who wants to dive in to this, the issue this post mentioned should be directly related to ```EditorResourcePreview::_iterate()```, and the progress bar is created at ```EditorResourcePreview::_idle_callback()```\n\nEDIT: \nSecond thought, moving md5 comparison to threads does not solve the issue, it will still become blocked when a file diff is detected and thumbnail needs to recreate. Still thinking a proper solution. Maybe I should investigate if moving the whole thumbnail creation process to thread is possible, if not, worst case scenario we should disable thumbnail creation by default when using Compatibility renderer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989232505/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989315545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989315545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989315545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yLVXZ","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T22:59:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T23:12:31Z","body":"UPDATE:\n\nI tried modifying the code at **editor/editor_resource_preview.cpp:132**\nfrom:\n```c++\nbool EditorResourcePreview::can_run_on_thread() const {\n\treturn RSG::rasterizer->can_create_resources_async();\n}\n```\n\nto:\n```c++\nbool EditorResourcePreview::can_run_on_thread() const {\n\treturn true;\n}\n```\n\nTo enforce thumbnail creation on thread when using Compatibility renderer, tested with a medium size project with 400+ resource/scene files, it creates all thumbnails normally without issue, even I hit play level while thumbnail is still generating.\n\nBut, that ```can_create_resources_async()``` check should be placed here for a reason ...? (Before 4.5, mesh and material resources are created single-threaded in Compatibility renderer, it's just we don't block it with a progress bar.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989315545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989373681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989373681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989373681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yLjjx","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T23:23:45Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T23:26:56Z","body":"@akien-mga \nCan someone in the rendering team explain why this is false, and what action is it intended to stop us from doing? Like, can't we create ```ImageTexture```, ```Texture2D``` on a thread? I tried it, it's fine so far.\n\n**drivers/gles3/rasterizer_gles3.h:137**\n```c++\n_ALWAYS_INLINE_ bool can_create_resources_async() const { return false; }\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989373681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989527676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989527676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989527676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yMJJ8","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T01:03:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T01:19:58Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107689\n\nWill disabling MSAA 8x help with this issue ? \n\nEdit: Well, if this only happens with the compatibility renderer, the problem isn't just about MSAA since it already disabled.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989527676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989537528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989537528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989537528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yMLj4","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T01:13:43Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T01:14:35Z","body":"\n> Behavior in the video is expected...\n> After you open the project for the second time, it scans and reads through all file to detect md5 checksum diffs, also assigns cached thumbnails to scene files if did not change. That's what it's actually doing, it's just the progress bar still shows \"Generate thumbnails\". But the process should be significantly faster compare to the first run, since it's just comparing md5 checksums.\n\nThis doesn't seem to be the case. The issue is that it runs the long process every single time the project is opened. Here's a video of me opening the project, waiting for it to finish the \"Generate Thumbnails\" step, closing it, reopening it, and waiting for \"Generate Thumbnails\" again:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d249c82-5822-4ca4-8f17-5dc81aacb098\n\nFirst \"Generate Thumbnails\" goes from 0:09 - 0:39 (30 seconds)\nSecond \"Generate Thumbnails\" goes from 0:55 - 01:26 (31 seconds)\n\nThese were also from a project where the resources had previously been imported into the project, i.e., I didn't add these resources to the project and then open it. If the behavior was as you said, in both cases it should've been doing only the MD5 checksum diffs each time, and taken much less than 30 seconds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989537528/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989576879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2989576879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2989576879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yMVKv","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T01:49:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T01:49:37Z","body":"> or a button to cancel that process\n\nPR #107744\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb4f5e9c-6b98-4ac6-965e-dfcfdfe8fc95)\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2989576879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990941918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2990941918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2990941918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yRibe","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T10:49:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T10:49:53Z","body":"Opened a PR #107757 attempt to fix this issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990941918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993474329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993474329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993474329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybMsZ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T09:04:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:23:07Z","body":"So I looked into this issue a bit more:\n- The previews are actually generated from FileSystem dock that requests previews for every file.\n- Previews generated at launch and these generated afterwards go through the same method\n- `queue_resource_preview()` is actually called multiple times when the editor is running, but after the first time, the preview data is cached in memory\n- As already noted above, only the first run actually generates previews, the editor keeps a preview cache (on disk, not the memory one), so subsequent project launches just read the cache, compare MD5 etc.\n- Note that preview cache has its own directory, deleting `.godot` folder does not invalidate it. The time measurements above likely didn't take that into account\n\nThe above means that the initial preview reading can't be disabled. Or more like, if it's disabled, the FileSystem dock will have no previews at all. The best solution is, assuming previews can't be generated in thread (though #107757 disproves that), split preview generation into cache reading and the actual generation, with the former being always threaded. I'll try that, even if the PR ends up reverted anyway.\n\nThat aside, I wonder how #102313 actually caused the issue. It did not change EditorFileSystem, it only changed how the previews are generated. Cache reading should be the same as before, unless I'm missing something.\n\nEDIT:\nOk I checked the reverting PR and indeed, the editor does generate previews in the same way, including a blocking call to reading the cache. The difference is that there is no progress bar :D Seems like it makes reading the cache take longer?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993474329/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993492472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993492472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993492472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybRH4","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T09:48:30Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:48:30Z","body":"Just my opinion. Generating thumbnail in single thread is very slow, and it's a CPU bottleneck rather than GPU (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107689#issuecomment-2991510689). If the compatibility renderer supports threading, that would be good (I don't know if it's possible. BTW in Forward+ I occasionally get  \"stack smashing detected\" crashs when there are lots of scene files).\n\nOtherwise, maybe thumbnails should be disabled when a large number of files are detected. I recall that Godot's code editor also seems unable to handle large JSON files, which freezes the editor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993492472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993494050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993494050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993494050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybRgi","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T09:52:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:52:36Z","body":"Yeah so, commenting out this line\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/08343189dc89678bfbb108c78ae923b66d5949af/editor/editor_resource_preview.cpp#L431\nfixed the problem.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993494050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993501050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993501050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993501050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybTN6","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:09:19Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T10:12:28Z","body":"> That aside, I wonder how [#102313](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313) actually caused the issue. It did not change EditorFileSystem, it only changed how the previews are generated. Cache reading should be the same as before, unless I'm missing something.\n\nCache reading is the same, it's just #102313 added a blocking progress bar onto it. \n\nBefore then the most heavy resource type to generate thumbnails for are mesh and material, and the \"non-blocking\" effect is done by a timer, before processing the next resource, it checks if the timer reaches 100ms, if it does, stop the process and reset timer, so the editor will be at least ~10fps during thumbnail creation.\n\nBut this can't be done by scene previews, as it's common that scenes will need over 100ms to load, some might reach 2000ms or worse. So a progress bar is implemented, but looking at it now, it's a terrible idea.\n\nSo if we want to implement this again in the future, assume single-threaded is still required. We should need either 1. Some method to estimate scene file complexity early, and skip it if reaches certain threshold. 2. Build the preview scene in background solely by using ```RenderingServer```, and make it stoppable at each sub resource (mesh, textures) creation. (This requires a lot of effort)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993501050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993657485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993657485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993657485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yb5aN","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T16:19:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T16:19:49Z","body":"I don't quite understand why the compatibility renderer can't render viewports in thread. Even if  `can_create_resources_async`  is false, all RenderingServer apis are still thread-safe through `CommandQueueMT`. I think it is a mistake to disable threading in compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993657485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993678513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107736#issuecomment-2993678513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107736","id":2993678513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yb-ix","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T17:09:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T17:10:14Z","body":"> Cache reading is the same, it's just [#102313](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102313) added a blocking progress bar onto it.\n\n\nI can confirm this, but I was also able to speed up `_idle_callback` (which is executed in compatibility mode). \nBy running `_iterate()` for up to 10 milliseconds, 10,000 steps in my test project were executed in under 2 seconds instead of 3 minutes.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2993592976\n\n<details><summary>code</summary>\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c231d0e7-fa1d-465c-87f3-027844575834)\n\n</details>\n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993678513/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]